---
import NavBar from "../components/NavBar.astro"
import Welcome from '../components/Welcome.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from "../components/footer.astro";

import style from "../style/global.css";
---

<Layout title = 'Home'>
<NavBar />
	<div class= "container">

		<div class = "Front" >
			<div class = "left">
				<p> ⟡ Hello, I'm </p>
				<p class = "name">Kahnishga Solaidurairaj </p1>
				<p>A Computer Science Student passionate about learning new skills and creating ✨</p>
        <a href = "/Portfolio/projects" class = "link">
				  <button class="primary-btn">View Projects →</button>
        </a>
      </div>
			<div class = "right">
				<img src="/Portfolio/images/home/compCoding.avif"/>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class = "WhatIOffer">
			<h1>What I Offer</h1>
			<h3>Explore my work, read my thoughts, and learn more about my journey in Computer Science</h3>
			<div class = "Card">
        <a href ="/Portfolio/projects" class = "link">
				  <div class="CardItem">
    				<h3>Projects</h3>
    				<p>Explore my web, mobile, and software projects.</p>
  				</div>
        </a>
        <!-- <a href = "/Portfolio/blog" class = "link">
  				<div class="CardItem">
    				<h3>Blog</h3>
    				<p>Read my thoughts on CS, tech, and programming.</p>
  				</div>
        </a> -->
        <a href = "/Portfolio/resume" class = "link">
  				<div class="CardItem">
    				<h3>Experience</h3>
    				<p>View my education, skills, and work history.</p>
  				</div>
        </a>
        <a href = "/Portfolio/contact" class = "link">
  				<div class="CardItem">
    				<h3>Contact</h3>
   					 <p>Reach out for opportunities or collaborations.</p>
  				</div>
        </a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class = "AboutMe">
			<h1> Get To Know Me</h1>
			<div class = "left-right">
        <img src = "/Portfolio/images/home/uic.avif" />
				<p> I’m a third-year Computer Science undergraduate at the University of Illinois at Chicago, with a minor in Mathematics and am a member of the Honors College. I live in the city and commute to campus, when the weather’s nice I like to bike, but I usually walk. At UIC, I enjoy being involved in WiCS, WiCys, WiEP, and participating in Commuter and Off-campus life events.</p>
      </div>

      <div class = "left-right">
        <p> From a young age, I have been drawn to creativity, whether through art, design, or problem-solving, which led me to programming. I love building, experimenting, and pushing my limits, and am always looking for new challenges to expand my skills. </p>
        <img src="/Portfolio/images/home/little.avif" />
      </div>

      <div class = "left-right">
        <div class="image carousel">
          <img src = "/Portfolio/images/home/crochet1.avif" />
          <img src = "/Portfolio/images/home/crochet2.avif" />
          <img src = "/Portfolio/images/home/books.avif" />
        </div> 
        <p> My hobbies outside of CS include crocheting and reading. I normally like to crochet smaller things like cute animals or objects. I also create tapestries, sweaters, and crochet flowers. I also like to read alot, my favorite genre is science-fiction, suspense, and thriller. I also read comics specifically webtoons.</p>
      </div>

      <div class = "left-right">
        <p> In my family, I’m the youngest, with an older sister I love to annoy and gossip with. She’s my go-to for advice, random information, and show recommendations. We love to work out together, mostly because it gives us more time to talk.</p>
        <div class="image carousel">
          <img src = "/Portfolio/images/home/sis1.avif" />
          <img src = "/Portfolio/images/home/sis2.avif" />
        </div> 
      </div>
      
      <div class = "left-right">
        <img src="/Portfolio/images/home/takingPics.avif" />
        <p> Lastly, I love to take pictures and capture my feelings + current intrests through scrapbooking, bullet journalling and just creating yearly albums. </p>
		  </div>
    </div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 2rem;
}

.Front {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 3rem;
  padding: 4rem 0;
}

.left .name {
  font-size: 3.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #2b59ff;
  margin-bottom: 0rem;
}

.left p {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  color: #6141ffff;
}

.right img {
  display: flex;
  width: auto;
  height: 420px;
  border-radius: 25px;
  box-shadow: 0px 1px 45px rgba(31, 65, 255, 1);
}

button, .primary-btn {
  padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8330ffff, #3374ffff, #55e3ffff);
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: none;
  color: white;
  font-size: 1rem;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: 0.25s ease;
}

button:hover, .primary-btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-3px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 67, 167, 0.36);
}

.WhatIOffer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 1rem;
}

.Card {
  display: grid;
  align: center;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));;
  gap: 2rem;
  margin-top: 4rem;
}

.CardItem {
  padding: 2rem;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  border-radius: 25px;
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  box-shadow: 0px 0px 45px rgba(255, 67, 167, 0.16);
  transition: 0.25s ease;
}

.CardItem:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
}

.link {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: inherit;
}

.AboutMe {
  padding: 3rem 0;
}

.left-right {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.left-right img {
  flex: 1;
  max-width: 300px;
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: 25px;
  box-shadow: 0px 10px 40px rgba(31, 65, 255, 0.25);
}

.left-right p {
  flex: 1;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  padding: 2.5rem;
  border-radius: 30px;
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  box-shadow: 0px 0px 45px rgba(255, 67, 167, 0.18);
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #3a2c7a;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .left-right {
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .left-right p {
    order: 1;
  }

  .Front {
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
  }
}

.image {
  width: 300px;
  height: auto;
  border-radius: 20px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

.image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.carousel {
  display: flex;
  overflow-x: auto;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
}

.carousel img {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 300px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  scroll-snap-align: center;
  object-fit: cover;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .Front {
    padding: 2.5rem 0;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .left .name {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
  }

  .right {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .right img {
    height: auto;
    max-width: 90%;
  }

  .Card {
    gam: 1.5rem;
  }

  .CardItem {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .carousel {
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .carousel img {
    width: 240px;
  }
}
</style>